---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Showcase from '../components/Showcase.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import ModalCard from '../components/ModalCard.astro';
const modals = [
  {
    Image: 'https://assets.aaflegalpractice.com/Backround3_edit.jpg',
    title: 'Our Story',
    openIcon: 'add',
    summary:
      'Founded in 2017 by three friends turned brothers, AAF Legal Practitioners was built with one mandate: to redefine legal practice standards in Nigeria and position itself as a trusted legal advisor internationally. Driven by innovation, excellence, and brotherhood, we deliver world-class counsel from Lagos, regionally and internationally...',
    body: [
      'It Did Not Start In A Boardroom. It Started As A Brotherhood.',
      'In 2017, three friends who had chosen to become brothers made a pact in Lagos. We looked at the legal profession we loved and asked a difficult question: Why does the practice of law evolve more slowly than the businesses it serves?',
      'As our client base rapidly evolved into global, technology-driven, and agile enterprises, the traditional legal service model remained overwhelmingly static, inefficient, and conventional. We recognized that Nigerian businesses required sophisticated, forward-thinking legal counsel tailored to match their innovative pace. Driven by this imperative, we established our practice on the firm conviction that Nigerian legal practitioners possess the caliber, acumen, and integrity to command absolute trust on the global stage.',
      'So we decided to build it ourselves. AAF Legal Practitioners was not founded on capital. It was founded on conviction. Three friends, one table, one obsession: to redefine the standard of legal practice in Nigeria. For eight years, we have lived that obsession. We made innovation a daily practice, not a slogan - in how we research, how we draft, how we negotiate, how we litigate, and how we advise. We combined rigorous legal training with commercial sense. We combined brotherhood with discipline.',
      'Our redefinition mandate has always had a clear destination: to place AAF as a trusted legal advisor not just in Nigeria, but in the international market. To build a firm from Lagos that can sit at any table internationally - and be trusted to deliver excellence without compromise. What started as a friendship has become an institution. What started as a local firm has become an international ambition.',
    ],
  },
  {
    Image:
      'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603796846097-bee99e4a601f?q=80&w=1074&auto=format&fit=crop&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=NHwxMjA3fDA%3D',
    title: 'Experience',
    openIcon: 'add',
    summary:
      'Our founding partners bring over three decades of high-calibre legal experience, building a dynamic, forward-thinking firm grounded in international best practices and deep sector-specific expertise...',
    body: [
      'Our founding partners bring over three decades of high-calibre legal experience, building a dynamic, forward-thinking firm grounded in international best practices and deep sector-specific expertise. Having individual tracks of intensive practice alongside some of West Africa’s most distinguished legal luminaries, our leadership bridges the agility of a modern enterprise with the sophisticated execution traditionally expected of heritage firms.',
      'We deliver premium, business-integrated legal solutions across a wide range of practice areas, helping clients navigate volatile markets and complex regulatory frameworks with confidence.',
      'Core Practice Strengths & Capabilities',
      'Corporate, Commercial & FinTech Advisory:',
      'We guide local enterprises, multi-nationals, and high-net-worth individuals through complex business formations, cross-border corporate restructuring, commercial portfolios, and market entries. Our advanced expertise extends into cutting-edge digital frontiers, including digital law, financial technology (FinTech) regulation, and data governance.',
      'Dispute Resolution & Trial Advocacy:',
      'Our partners possess deep familiarity with the full hierarchy of the Nigerian court system, handling high-stakes civil, criminal, and constitutional litigation with a formidable record of trial success.',
      'International Arbitration & Crisis Management:',
      'Actively engaged in alternative dispute resolution (ADR), we deploy tactical conflict-avoidance strategies and represent clients in sophisticated domestic and international arbitral proceedings.',
      'Energy, Infrastructure & Natural Resources:',
      'We provide robust regulatory and transactional counsel across the value chains of the Oil and Gas, mining, and renewable energy sectors. Our team offers strategic advisory services that align client projects with complex legal compliance requirements and international standards.',
      'Real Estate, Construction & Asset Management:',
      'From cross-border asset tracing and business recoveries to complex property development transactions, we manage and protect multi-million Naira real estate and infrastructure portfolios.',
      'Specialized Industrial Sectors:',
      'Our multidisciplinary framework ensures boutique-level precision in specialized commercial fields, including Aviation, Maritime law, Immigration and labor relations, and the emerging regulatory landscape of Sports Law.',
    ],
  },
  {
    Image: 'https://assets.aaflegalpractice.com/Goals_edit.jpg',
    title: 'Goals',
    openIcon: 'add',
    summary:
      'The firm aims to redefine the standards of legal practice in Nigeria, by adopting international best practices and implementing them in our style and approach to everyday issues faced by our clients...',
    body: [
      'The firm aims to redefine the standards of legal practice in Nigeria, by adopting international best practices and implementing them in our style and approach to everyday issues faced by our clients. Ultimately, the firm will be an instrument of social restructuring in Nigeria and in the international community.',
    ],
  },
];
---

<Layout title="AAF About page">
  <Navbar showcase={false} />
  <Showcase showcase={false} title="About" />
  {
    modals.map((modal) => (
      <ModalCard
        Image={modal.Image}
        title={modal.title}
        openIcon={modal.openIcon}
        summary={modal.summary}
        body={modal.body}
      />
    ))
  }

  <!-- <slot /> -->
</Layout>
